.TH "mpvc-equalizer" "1" "April, 2026" "" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
mpvc-equalizer - manage and adjust audio filter equalizer settings for
mpvc
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IP
.nf
\f[C]
usage: mpvc-equalizer opts # \[at]version v1.8 (c) gmt4 https://github.com/gmt4/mpvc
 save   : Saves equalizer settings
 load   : Loads equalizer settings
 reset  : Resets equalizer settings (set af gains to 0)
 clear  : Clears equalizer settings (clear af)
 toggle : toggle equalizer settings (toggle af)
 preset : Show/Set equalizer settings preset
 values : Show equalizer settings as float values
 bars   : Show equalizer settings as graph bars
 json   : Show equalizer settings as JSON
*tips: If unsure about where to begin, start with: mpvc-equalizer preset
\f[R]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
mpvc-equalizer is a utility helper script bundled with mpvc that
configures, toggles, and displays the audio filter (af) equalizer
settings of a running mpv instance via local Unix socket connections.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]\f[CB]save\f[B]\f[R]
Save the current audio filter equalizer adjustments and gain parameters
to the configuration storage.
.TP
\f[B]\f[CB]load\f[B]\f[R]
Load previously saved audio filter equalizer configuration profiles
directly into the active playback engine workspace.
.TP
\f[B]\f[CB]reset\f[B]\f[R]
Reset all equalizer configuration adjustments back to a flat level by
setting all audio filter gains to 0.
.TP
\f[B]\f[CB]clear\f[B]\f[R]
Clear and completely remove the active audio filter configuration
settings from the running instance context.
.TP
\f[B]\f[CB]toggle\f[B]\f[R]
Toggle the audio filter equalizer settings on or off to quickly contrast
modified frequencies with baseline flat audio output.
.TP
\f[B]\f[CB]preset\f[B]\f[R]
Show the active audio filter configuration profile or set the equalizer
matrix to a predefined listening preset.
.TP
\f[B]\f[CB]values\f[B]\f[R]
Output the current audio filter equalizer gain parameters formatted as a
list of raw float values.
.TP
\f[B]\f[CB]bars\f[B]\f[R]
Render a visual representation of the active frequency band gain
configurations using terminal text graph bars.
.TP
\f[B]\f[CB]json\f[B]\f[R]
Export the complete active equalizer audio filter settings profile
structured into a standard JSON payload format string.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Interact with or assign predefined audio equalizing balance templates
.IP
.nf
\f[C]
    mpvc-equalizer preset
\f[R]
.fi
.PP
Visually audit configured frequency band gains using terminal graphs
.IP
.nf
\f[C]
    mpvc-equalizer bars
\f[R]
.fi
.PP
Toggle active equalizer constraints to evaluate listening profiles
.IP
.nf
\f[C]
    mpvc-equalizer toggle
\f[R]
.fi
.PP
Reset all frequency gains back to 0 to balance structural playback
.IP
.nf
\f[C]
    mpvc-equalizer reset
\f[R]
.fi
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
MPV_SOCKET
Override the default MPV socket path.
Used by internal companion script wrappers to identify which instance
target context boundaries apply.
.TP
XDG_CONFIG_HOME
Directory where mpvc configurations are systematically discovered.
Defaults to \[ti]/.config/ if not specified by your shell environment
variables.
.SH FILES
.TP
\[ti]/.config/mpvc/mpvc.conf
Core mpvc-specific runtime configurations, variable flags, and system
mapping settings.
